# Default-deny repository policy.
#
# Everything is ignored unless it is explicitly allow-listed below. This is
# intentional: genome inputs, generated bundles, local configuration, resource
# snapshots, logs, and credentials must never be committed accidentally.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!.github/
!.github/**
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!README.md
!SECURITY.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!MANIFEST.in
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!config/
!config/config.example.yaml
!config/release-c-adapters.example.json
!config/release-c-matrix.example.json
!config/mt-call-policy.example.json
!config/release-c-resource-metadata.example.json
!config/release-c-resources.example.json
!config/release-c.example.yaml
!containers/
!containers/**
!docs/
!docs/**
!schemas/
!schemas/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!src/
!src/**
!tests/
!tests/**
!workflow/
!workflow/**

# Test fixtures are allow-listed by directory, but genomic-looking files still
# require explicit synthetic names below.
!tests/fixtures/synthetic*.vcf
!tests/fixtures/synthetic*.vcf.gz
!tests/fixtures/synthetic*.vcf.gz.tbi
!tests/fixtures/synthetic*.bed
!tests/fixtures/synthetic*.tsv
!tests/fixtures/synthetic*.json
!tests/fixtures/synthetic*.yaml

# Never allow secrets or local environment files, even in allow-listed trees.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*credential*
**/*secret*
**/*token*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx

# Never allow real genomics or generated bundle payloads. Synthetic test files
# must use the explicit exceptions above.
**/*.bam
**/*.bai
**/*.cram
**/*.crai
**/*.sam
**/*.fastq
**/*.fastq.gz
**/*.fq
**/*.fq.gz
**/*.gvcf
**/*.gvcf.gz
**/*.bcf
**/*.bcf.csi
**/*.vcf
**/*.vcf.gz
**/*.vcf.gz.tbi
**/*.vcf.gz.csi
**/*.fa
**/*.fasta
**/*.fna
**/*.fa.fai
**/*.fasta.fai
**/*.dict
**/*.parquet
**/*.genome/
**/*.genome.zip
**/*.duckdb
**/*.sqlite
**/*.db
**/*.bw
**/*.bigWig
**/*.zip
**/*.tar
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.xlsx
**/*.xls

# Private task descriptions, local config, data, caches, and runtime outputs.
TASK.md
config/config.yaml
config/*.local.yaml
private/
data/
inputs/
outputs/
results/
resources/
work/
tmp/
logs/
.cache/
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Re-open only explicitly named synthetic fixtures after global genomic bans.
!tests/fixtures/synthetic*.vcf
!tests/fixtures/synthetic*.vcf.gz
!tests/fixtures/synthetic*.vcf.gz.tbi
!tests/fixtures/synthetic*.fa
!tests/fixtures/synthetic*.fa.fai
